+      - Applications and drivers must set this to zero.
+    * - __u16
+      - ``view_order_idx``
+      - MVC view order index (VOIdx) of the view the picture belongs to, see
+        ``V4L2_CID_STATELESS_H264_MVC_VIEWS``. Zero for pictures of the base
